items.source:
Entrypoint for CQL generation of <a href="../keyspace/CqlSpecification.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.keyspace"><code>CqlSpecification</code></a> objects representing DML statements such as table creations
or keyspace drops. For example:

<pre class="code">DropUserTypeSpecification spec = SpecificationBuilder.dropType("address");
String cql = CqlGenerator.toCql(spec);
</pre>

items.translation:
用于生成代表 DML 语句（如表创建或 keyspace 删除）的 <a href="../keyspace/CqlSpecification.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.keyspace"><code>CqlSpecification</code></a> 对象的 CQL 入口点。例如：

<pre class="code">DropUserTypeSpecification spec = SpecificationBuilder.dropType("address");
String cql = CqlGenerator.toCql(spec);
</pre>
